      "trackName": "Block Trainer Watch",
      "description": "Block Trainer Watch is a focused block stacking trainer designed for quick, deliberate practice right from your wrist.\n\nThere is no gravity, giving you complete control to think through each move, study the board, and build better habits without pressure.\n\nDesigned to complement the iPhone version of Block Trainer, this watch experience lets you train anytime, anywhere.\n\nFeatures\n\t•\tNo gravity for thoughtful, stress-free practice\n\t•\t40 Line Clear mode\n\t•\tAll 62 special rotation training exercises\n\t•\tREN mode for practicing line clear chaining\n\nBuilt for focused training sessions you can jump into anytime, anywhere.",
